# .templateignore
#
# Gitignore-syntax manifest of files stripped when `create-sailor` scaffolds
# a new project from this repo. Nebutra-Sailor is simultaneously (1) the
# template source and (2) Nebutra's live product codebase — this file
# separates Nebutra-specific business content from the reusable skeleton.
#
# Rules:
#   - Use gitignore syntax (supports globs, negation with `!`).
#   - Keep packages/* fully intact (they are the reusable primitives).
#   - Preserve skeleton files (layout.tsx, globals.css, package.json, etc.).
#   - When adding new Nebutra-owned code, add it here.
#
# Validate: `pnpm template:check`

